  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">At Paws and Pastures, we sell merchandise ranging from Phone cases (our best sellers) all the way to clothing which is releasing very soon, so we need your help promoting! We’ve started in my bedroom making designs for my cases and have found the accounts to grow VERY fast, meaning we are already well into building an amazing brand reputation. We currently specialise in farm and country side products, however within the next week we aim to have launched out pet themed ones too! Cats, dogs and other pets!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">At Paws and Pastures we understand how sometimes our designs might not look like your animal! And that’s okay, we offer custom ones too for those who want a more personalised feel.<br>• How to promote us:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">We’d appreciate any marketing that you deem suitable. I must say, under no conditions should any form of AI be used, or we may have to void your affiliation with us. The brand shouldn’t be represented in a negative way. However, please feel free to promote anywhere, and make content ranging from unboxing videos to casual videos where the product is just in the background (e.g. a mirror lipsyncing video where you can see the case). Make sure to always tag us if you do, and pop your code there too!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Please also feel free to place your affiliate link and code on all your social accounts. No intrusive or pushy, and no guilt tripping as marketing to be used, and if you are unsure please contact us for approval of your idea. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">You will receive 10% commission per sale made using your code or link, and will be paid your earnings on the 1st of each month, regardless of how much is in there, there isn’t a minimum or maximum, so go crazy!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">Please get in contact if you have any questions, we hope to see you working with us!</p></div></div>",
